  "title": "Spicy Grilled Chicken",
  "description": "This is a slightly hot lime juice based marinade that adds wonderful flavors to grilled chicken. The breasts marinate in the fridge for about an hour and are grilled until moist and crispy brown.",
  "authors": [
    "Jenn H"
  ],
